<tr><td>Topical ivermectin 0.5% lotion</td><td>塗頭髮一次（多數專家建議一週後再塗）</td><td>Approved for patients older than age <strong class="ex-n">6 months</strong></td></tr>
<tr><td>Ivermectin（Stromectol）oral 200 µg/kg</td><td>口服 days <strong class="ex-n">1, 8, 15</strong></td><td>對成蟲療效很好，但 inferior to permethrin；<strong>not ovicidal</strong>，nits 孵化前不受影響；not recommended for pregnant females 或 &lt;15 kg（33 lbs）兒童；未獲 FDA 核准用於 pediculosis</td></tr>
<tr><td>Spinosad 0.9% suspension</td><td>塗乾髮 <strong class="ex-n">10 minutes</strong>，沖掉，<strong class="ex-n">7 days</strong> 後重複</td><td>含 benzyl alcohol，<strong class="ex-n">&lt;6 months</strong> 嬰兒不可用；副作用輕微</td></tr>
